        "en": "I think I see it something like this. First of all, this apprehension of my act by God cannot be posited as an objective datum (in the sense in which I might say, for instance, that someone is at this moment picking up my words by wireless). It cannot be conceived by me unless I am myself on a certain spiritual level. I sail cannot see clearly what follows from this, but I feel it will be important."
