        "en": "1 1 think I should here point out the fundamental agreement between these views and those of Jaspers, which I did not know in 193 1. (Note written August, 1934.) This I do sec: that the privilege or primacy which I ascribe to my mental equipment, and to what belongs to it, is conceived or imagined by analogy with the fundamental and unthinkable privilege which distinguishes my body in so far as it is mine. In this privilege my ideas, in so far as they are mine, have an indirect share."
