        "en": "The problem of the relation of soul and body is more than a problem: that is the implicit conclusion of Existence and Objectivity. 1 Something unrepresentable yet concrete something which is more than an idea, and exceeds every idea we can form, something which is a presence. An object as such is not present. 2"
