        "en": "(2) The metaproblematic is a participation on which my reality as subject is built (WE DO NOT BELONG TO OURSELVES); and reflection will show us that such a participation, if it is genuine, cannot be a solution. If it were, it would cease to be a participation in transcendent reality, and would become, instead, an interpolation into transcendent reality, and would be degraded in the process."
