        "en": "OUTLINE OF AN ESSAY READ TO THE SOCIETY OF PHILOSOPHICAL STUDIES at Marseilles, on January 2ist, 1933, on the Position of the Ontological Mystery and the Concrete Approaches to it. (A) If we consider the present position of philosophical thought, as expressed in the depths of a consciousness which is trying to fathom its own needs, we are led, I think, to make the following observations:"
