        "fr": "ayant en moi ou plus précisément à moi certains caractères, certains apanages, je me considère du",
        "en": "We can only express ourselves in terms of having when we are moving on a level where, in whatever manner and whatever degree of transposition, the contrast between within and without retains a meaning."
